      "writtenOn": "2023-10-31T10:31:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This shouldn\u0027t fail and we constructed the key. It primarily verifies that the key parameters in the `CoseKey` correspond to the curve/algorithm we support, ensuring that we can correctly use the EC P-256 curve to restore the key after it (line 228).",
      "parentUuid": "74bba889_559763ca",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 233,
        "startChar": 3,
